  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: NiseParentingJournal_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c869184c2ee9f24fa15ac58249f3e37, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 4831633408
    m_Localized: The window. Beyond the window. Three people laughing. "Father" "Mother"
      "Baby." In that woman's arms, the baby is laughing. That's my place. That's
      mine. All I want is Keita.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6597435392
    m_Localized: '

      I''ll kill those two. I''ll become the real "mother." I''ll
      "rescue" Keita from that woman. I''ve already decided.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8354848768
    m_Localized: 'That woman is foolish. She trusts me completely. I even have a
      spare key.


'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10095484928
    m_Localized: In the darkness of night, I killed them both. It was very quiet.
      I finished it in the pink room without making a sound.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11953561600
    m_Localized: I picked up Keita sleeping in the cradle. Finally, I got him back.
      Keita cried in my arms. It's okay. It's all okay now. "I'm your real mother."
      From today, this is our "home."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13979410432
    m_Localized: 'After killing those two and disposing of the bodies, large blood
      stains remained on the floor. The smell was terrible. The quickest way to hide
      these traces was to spread bleach.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15715852288
    m_Localized: I spread massive amounts of industrial-strength bleach from work,
      enough to soak the floor. This way, the blood color, smell, and all evidence
      of what happened here will disappear. The floor became patchy and bleached
      white, but that's much better than leaving their traces. Now, this house becomes
      "our home" for just Keita and me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17347436544
    m_Localized: 'But even though I perfectly erased them, this house sometimes makes
      noises. At night, in the Japanese-style room and living room, sounds like something
      being dragged, creaking sounds.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19067101184
    m_Localized: They're still trying to stay in this house. I can't let them have
      a bad influence on Keita. So I placed purifying salt and put talismans in that
      pink room to keep them from coming out. This should keep them quiet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20610605056
    m_Localized: 'I posted rules to protect the house. Keita only needs to look at
      me. For that purpose, I installed small surveillance cameras throughout the
      house. Now I can watch all the time.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22053445632
    m_Localized: When Keita got a bit older, I thought he needed "siblings." To create
      a more perfect "family," I brought some promising kids from the neighborhood.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23508869120
    m_Localized: But it didn't work. None of them saw me as "Mom" like Keita does.
      They just cried and screamed, wouldn't follow the rules. They couldn't become
      Keita's "siblings."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24989458432
    m_Localized: The ones who didn't fit were failures. I had to dismantle them.
      In the end, Keita is enough as my child. Only he is my perfect child.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26612654080
    m_Localized: 'Today, I saw Keita walking with some kid I don''t know. A friend?
      I won''t allow it. Keita is mine. I won''t tolerate "trash." That kid... I''ll
      kill him.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 496924155904
    m_Localized: Miwa's Diary
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
